          {
            "title": "Question 6",
            "id": 112453,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa tujuan ES6?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Memperbaiki masalah dan meningkatkan sintaks JS</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Untuk membuat scope baru</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Untuk menyertakan kata-kata khusus baru</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Memperbaiki masalah dan meningkatkan sintaks JS.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Edisi JavaScript baru harus mengatasi sintaks lama yang janggal dan memperjelas kode yang umum. Apa tujuan ES6?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Memperbaiki masalah dan meningkatkan sintaks JS</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Untuk membuat scope baru</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Untuk menyertakan kata-kata khusus baru</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Untuk menggantikan JavaScript</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Memperbaiki masalah dan meningkatkan sintaks JS.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 3",
            "id": 112438,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa cakupan variabel <code>age</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt;= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age = i * \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;I am &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + age + \" /><text value=\"&quot; years old.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"I am 10 years old.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"I am 20 years old.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"I am 30 years old.\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Cakupan Blok</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Scope Lokal</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Scope Global</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Cakupan Blok.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Deklarasi <code>age</code> menggunakan <code>const</code> di dalam kurung kurawal perulangan. Di mana variabel tersebut dapat digunakan?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt;= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age = i * \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;I am &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + age + \" /><text value=\"&quot; years old.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"I am 10 years old.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"I am 20 years old.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"I am 30 years old.\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Cakupan Blok</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Scope Lokal</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Scope Global</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Scope Modul</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih Cakupan Blok.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 5",
            "id": 112439,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jenis variabel apa <code>countdown</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" countdown = \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt;= \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" countdown--;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(countdown);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"0\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Global</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Lokal</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Blok</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih Global.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perulangan mengubah <code>countdown</code>, tetapi deklarasinya muncul sebelum perulangan dimulai. Apa scope <code>countdown</code> di sini?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" countdown = \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt;= \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" countdown--;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(countdown);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"0\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Global</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Lokal</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Blok</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Fungsi</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih Global.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 9",
            "id": 112461,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Variabel mana yang berada dalam cakupan blok?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" featureEnabled = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"toggleFeature\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" logMessage = \" /><text value=\"'Feature status: '\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (featureEnabled) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" action = \" /><text value=\"'Disabling feature...'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(logMessage + action);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    featureEnabled = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" action = \" /><text value=\"'Enabling feature...'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(logMessage + action);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    featureEnabled = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toggleFeature();\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>action</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>featureEnabled</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>logMessage</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>action</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Di dalam <code>toggleFeature</code>, kamu menambahkan <code>console.log(action)</code> setelah seluruh <code>if/else</code>. Apa yang terjadi?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" featureEnabled = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"toggleFeature\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" logMessage = \" /><text value=\"'Feature status: '\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (featureEnabled) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" action = \" /><text value=\"'Disabling feature...'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(logMessage + action);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    featureEnabled = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" action = \" /><text value=\"'Enabling feature...'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(logMessage + action);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    featureEnabled = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toggleFeature();\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">ReferenceError terjadi karena action terbatas pada blok cabangnya.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Log menampilkan Disabling feature... karena cabang itu berjalan.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Log menampilkan Enabling feature... karena featureEnabled sekarang false.</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Log menampilkan undefined karena keluar dari blok menghapus action.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">ReferenceError terjadi karena action terbatas pada blok cabangnya.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 112429,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jenis variabel apa yang tidak dapat dideklarasikan ulang atau nilainya diperbarui?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>const</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>let</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>var</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>const</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu menetapkan nilai konfigurasi satu kali dan harus mencegah penetapan maupun deklarasi ulang. Keyword deklarasi mana yang harus dipilih?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>const</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>let</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>var</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>static</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>const</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Parenthesis",
            "id": 103790,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tulis sintaks yang membuat arrow function tanpa parameter.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getStudentsCount = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getStudentsCount());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>(</code>, diikuti oleh <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tulis sintaks yang membuat arrow function tanpa parameter. Lengkapi daftar parameter dan arrow agar fungsi menampilkan <code>200</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getStudentsCount = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getStudentsCount());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>(</code>, diikuti oleh <code>)</code>, dan terakhir <code>=&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Arrow operator",
            "id": 103792,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kodekan nilai yang digunakan untuk mendeklarasikan fungsi arrow.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getStudentsCount = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getStudentsCount());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>=&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lengkapi arrow function agar mengembalikan nilai <code>bookCount</code> yang tersimpan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"bookCount\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getBookCount\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"bookCount\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"log\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"getBookCount\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getBookCount\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>=&gt;</code>, diikuti oleh <code>bookCount</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Multiple body statements",
            "id": 103800,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Isi nilai yang hilang dalam kode berikut.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getStudentsCount = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getStudentsCount());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>{</code>, diikuti oleh <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Arrow function ini menyimpan nilai sebelum mengembalikannya. Lengkapi isi blok agar kode menampilkan <code>200</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getStudentsCount = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getStudentsCount());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>{</code>, diikuti oleh <code>return</code>, dan terakhir <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: One body statement",
            "id": 103793,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat fungsi arrow yang akan mengembalikan nilai <code>200</code> saat dipanggil.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getStudentsCount = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getStudentsCount());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"34\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>() =&gt; 200</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Calling the function",
            "id": 103795,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Panggil arrow function di dalam pernyataan display.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getCount = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getCount());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"85\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>getCount()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Calling an arrow function",
            "id": 103820,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana hasil menjalankan kode berikut?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getRatio = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"first, second\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" first / second;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getRatio(\" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>10</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>40</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>22</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu membalik argumen untuk memanggil <code>getRatio(2, 20)</code>. Apa yang sekarang ditampilkan console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getRatio = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"first, second\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" first / second;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getRatio(\" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">0.1</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">10</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">40</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">22</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih 0.1.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Default parameter value",
            "id": 103822,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang salah dengan kode berikut?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getDouble = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" number * \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getDouble());\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"NaN\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Kita perlu menetapkan nilai parameter default agar <code>NaN</code> tidak ditampilkan</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Menggunakan tanda kurung dengan satu parameter menyebabkan error</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Kurung kurawal tidak ada</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Kita perlu menetapkan nilai parameter default agar <code>NaN</code> tidak ditampilkan.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>getDouble()</code> tidak memberikan nilai untuk <code>number</code>, sehingga perkalian menghasilkan <code>NaN</code>. Perubahan apa yang memperbaikinya?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getDouble = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" number * \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getDouble());\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"NaN\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Kita perlu menetapkan nilai parameter default agar <code>NaN</code> tidak ditampilkan</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Menggunakan tanda kurung dengan satu parameter menyebabkan error</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Kurung kurawal tidak ada</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Fungsi memerlukan parameter kedua</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Kita perlu menetapkan nilai parameter default agar <code>NaN</code> tidak ditampilkan.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Default parameter value",
            "id": 103817,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan nilai parameter default <code>0</code> ke fungsi arrow.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getConvertedHours = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"seconds = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" seconds / \" /><text value=\"3600\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getConvertedHours());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>seconds</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan nilai parameter default <code>0</code> ke arrow function. Lengkapi penetapan parameter agar pemanggilan tanpa argumen menampilkan <code>0</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getConvertedHours = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"seconds = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" seconds / \" /><text value=\"3600\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getConvertedHours());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"minutes\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3600\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>=</code>, diikuti oleh <code>seconds</code>, <code>0</code>, dan terakhir <code>seconds</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: One parameter II",
            "id": 103818,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tulis sintaks sesingkat mungkin yang meneruskan satu parameter, <code>seconds</code>, ke arrow function.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getConvertedHours = \" /><text value=\"seconds\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" seconds / \" /><text value=\"3600\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getConvertedHours(\" /><text value=\"7200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"33\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>seconds</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
